{"fiche_id": "KB0030001", "client": "clienta", "title": "Outlook ne démarre plus", "source": "KB0030001.md", "text": "## Symptôme\nOutlook reste bloqué au démarrage, erreur 0x80070005.\n\n## Cause\nUn complément COM défectueux ou un fichier .ost corrompu.\n\n## Résolution\n1. Fermez Outlook.\n2. Lancez Outlook en mode sans échec avec la commande outlook.exe /safe.\n3. Si Outlook démarre en mode sans échec, allez dans Fichier > Options > Compléments et désactivez les compléments COM.\n4. Si le problème persiste, supprimez le fichier .ost dans %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Microsoft\\Outlook puis relancez Outlook.\n", "text_sha256": "d42e07568d03aedc86c0a653fcf9a3d2715ea09135dad5debe901304e9dc6093", "status": "citable", "confidence": "low", "reasons": ["single method: the LLM pass did not run"], "sections": [{"title": "Symptôme", "role": "symptom", "start": 12, "end": 67}, {"title": "Cause", "role": "cause", "start": 76, "end": 135}, {"title": "Résolution", "role": "resolution", "start": 149, "end": 476}], "steps": [{"n": 1, "start": 152, "end": 167, "text": "Fermez Outlook.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["app:outlook"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 2, "start": 171, "end": 240, "text": "Lancez Outlook en mode sans échec avec la commande outlook.exe /safe.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["app:outlook", "cmd:outlook.exe /safe"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 3, "start": 244, "end": 360, "text": "Si Outlook démarre en mode sans échec, allez dans Fichier > Options > Compléments et désactivez les compléments COM.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": "Si Outlook démarre en mode sans échec", "after_failure": false, "on_failure": 4, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["app:outlook", "menu:fichier > options > complements"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 4, "start": 364, "end": 475, "text": "Si le problème persiste, supprimez le fichier .ost dans %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Microsoft\\Outlook puis relancez Outlook.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": "Si le problème persiste", "after_failure": true, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["path:%localappdata%\\microsoft\\outlook", "app:outlook"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}], "entities": [{"canonical": "app:outlook", "kind": "app", "count": 7}, {"canonical": "cmd:outlook.exe /safe", "kind": "command", "count": 1}, {"canonical": "err:0x80070005", "kind": "error", "count": 1}, {"canonical": "menu:fichier > options > complements", "kind": "menu", "count": 1}, {"canonical": "path:%localappdata%\\microsoft\\outlook", "kind": "path", "count": 1}], "references": [], "methods": {"rules_steps": 4, "llm": null, "agreement": null}, "checks": {"steps_verified": 4, "steps_total": 4, "resolution_steps": 4, "failure_links": 1, "llm_quotes_rejected": 0, "instructions_dropped": 0}, "boilerplate_removed": 0, "masked": {}, "version": 1}
