{"fiche_id": "KB0030003", "client": "clienta", "title": "Caméra noire dans Teams", "source": "KB0030003.md", "text": "## Symptôme\nLa caméra reste noire pendant les réunions dans Teams.\n\n## Résolution\n1. Vérifiez que le cache de la caméra n'est pas obstrué.\n2. Dans Teams, ouvrez Paramètres > Appareils et sélectionnez la bonne caméra.\n3. Redémarrez le poste.\n", "text_sha256": "77820fdd364e721de33618dba652a959c24563e34b733858be4fb40c3c940e75", "status": "citable", "confidence": "low", "reasons": ["single method: the LLM pass did not run"], "sections": [{"title": "Symptôme", "role": "symptom", "start": 12, "end": 68}, {"title": "Résolution", "role": "resolution", "start": 82, "end": 241}], "steps": [{"n": 1, "start": 85, "end": 138, "text": "Vérifiez que le cache de la caméra n'est pas obstrué.", "kind": "check", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": [], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 2, "start": 142, "end": 216, "text": "Dans Teams, ouvrez Paramètres > Appareils et sélectionnez la bonne caméra.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["app:teams", "menu:parametres > appareils"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 3, "start": 220, "end": 240, "text": "Redémarrez le poste.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": [], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}], "entities": [{"canonical": "app:teams", "kind": "app", "count": 3}, {"canonical": "menu:parametres > appareils", "kind": "menu", "count": 1}], "references": [], "methods": {"rules_steps": 3, "llm": null, "agreement": null}, "checks": {"steps_verified": 3, "steps_total": 3, "resolution_steps": 3, "failure_links": 0, "llm_quotes_rejected": 0