{"fiche_id": "KB0030004", "client": "clienta", "title": "VPN GlobalProtect déconnexions fréquentes", "source": "KB0030004.md", "text": "## Symptôme\nLa connexion VPN GlobalProtect se coupe toutes les 10 minutes, erreur 1722.\n\n## Résolution\n1. Vérifiez que le poste est bien connecté au Wi-Fi d'entreprise.\n2. Ouvrez une invite de commande et exécutez ipconfig /flushdns.\n3. Redémarrez le client GlobalProtect.\n", "text_sha256": "5e90c984acce8280be96902619e6ac9dd54ea2a905716a26c389a3e6e10e920f", "status": "citable", "confidence": "low", "reasons": ["single method: the LLM pass did not run"], "sections": [{"title": "Symptôme", "role": "symptom", "start": 12, "end": 89}, {"title": "Résolution", "role": "resolution", "start": 103, "end": 273}], "steps": [{"n": 1, "start": 106, "end": 168, "text": "Vérifiez que le poste est bien connecté au Wi-Fi d'entreprise.", "kind": "check", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": [], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 2, "start": 172, "end": 233, "text": "Ouvrez une invite de commande et exécutez ipconfig /flushdns.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["cmd:ipconfig /flushdns"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 3, "start": 237, "end": 272, "text": "Redémarrez le client GlobalProtect.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["app:globalprotect"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}], "entities": [{"canonical": "app:globalprotect", "kind": "app", "count": 3}, {"canonical": "cmd:ipconfig /flushdns", "kind": "command", "count": 1}, {"canonical": "err:1722", "kind": "error", "count": 1}], "references": [], "methods": {"rules_steps": 3, "llm": null, "agreement"