{"fiche_id": "KB0030005", "client": "clienta", "title": "Compte Active Directory verrouillé", "source": "KB0030005.md", "text": "## Symptôme\nL'utilisateur ne peut plus se connecter, son compte est verrouillé dans Active Directory.\n\n## Résolution\n1. Ouvrez Active Directory Users and Computers.\n2. Déverrouillez le compte de l'utilisateur.\n3. Demandez à l'utilisateur de réinitialiser son mot de passe.\n", "text_sha256": "7efde9f45182450bfea9ca17648308cf70c34d809e29e153632172f98ad84c94", "status": "citable", "confidence": "low", "reasons": ["single method: the LLM pass did not run"], "sections": [{"title": "Symptôme", "role": "symptom", "start": 12, "end": 103}, {"title": "Résolution", "role": "resolution", "start": 117, "end": 273}], "steps": [{"n": 1, "start": 120, "end": 164, "text": "Ouvrez Active Directory Users and Computers.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": ["app:active-directory"], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 2, "start": 168, "end": 209, "text": "Déverrouillez le compte de l'utilisateur.", "kind": "action", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": [], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}, {"n": 3, "start": 213, "end": 272, "text": "Demandez à l'utilisateur de réinitialiser son mot de passe.", "kind": "check", "role": "resolution", "level": 0, "condition": null, "after_failure": false, "on_failure": null, "goto": null, "instruction": null, "entities": [], "refers_to": [], "sources": ["rules"]}], "entities": [{"canonical": "app:active-directory", "kind": "app", "count": 3}], "references": [], "methods": {"rules_steps": 3, "llm": null, "agreement": null}, "checks": {"steps_verified": 3, "steps_total": 3, "resolution_steps": 3, "failure_links": 0, "llm_quotes_rejected": 0, "instructions_dropped": 0}, "boilerpla